  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Advisory services needed for the implementation of core support to selected Albanian CSOs. These include audit services and mentoring and coaching for CSOs. Two contracts are included under this contribution.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">R&#xe5;dgivningstj&#xe4;nster som beh&#xf6;vs f&#xf6;r genomf&#xf6;randet av k&#xe4;rnst&#xf6;d till utvalda albanska civilsamh&#xe4;llesorganisationer. Det handlar bland annat om revisionstj&#xe4;nster och mentorskap och coachning f&#xf6;r civilsamh&#xe4;llesorganisationer. Tv&#xe5; kontrakt ing&#xe5;r i detta bidrag.</narrative>
  </description>
